  "notes": "**Hutsix v3.1.0**(released)\n\n### Keyboard & Mouse Actions\n- Actions now have a **Min delay** setting (10 ms by default): the shortest pause allowed between steps. It keeps a sped-up recording from running faster than a game can keep up with.\n- When a recorded pause would end up shorter than that, Hutsix waits for your minimum instead. Your saved actions are never changed.\n- If the settings still leave some pauses shorter than 10 ms (about one frame at 60 FPS), the action window warns you that the game may skip those steps.\n- Actions you recorded earlier keep behaving the same, apart from any pause that was shorter than 10 ms \u2014 those now take 10 ms.",
